Life is but span--of horses;


One is cage" the other "Prime J"
Up and down the hill our course is;
go in ponies your time"
Boyhood plies the whip of pleasure;


Youthful folly gives the stroke;
Manhood goads them at his leisure,


"Let 'em rip" "they'r tough as oak
ali, yal there" the stakes we'il pocket
To the wind let care be sent;
Time, 2;4O. "Whip in socket


Give em string, and let 'em went"
On the sunny road to fifty,


"Prime" is drowed in Lethes stream
cage is left, lame, old, unthrifty;


Life then proves one-horSe team.
"Age' jogs on, grows quite unsteady,
Reels and slacke in his pace;
"Kicks the bucket" always ready;


"Gives it up"-Death wins the race.

article_spellcheck:
Life is but a span of horses;

One is cage, the other "Prime";
Up and down the hill our course is;
Go in ponies your time;
Boyhood plies the whip of pleasure;

Youthful folly gives the stroke;
Manhood goads them at his leisure,

"Let 'em rip," "they're tough as oak;
All y'all there," the stakes we'll pocket;
To the wind let care be sent;
Time, 2:40. "Whip in socket;

Give 'em string, and let 'em went;
On the sunny road to fifty,

"Prime" is drowned in Lethe's stream;
Cage is left, lame, old, unthrifty;

Life then proves one-horse team.
Age jogs on, grows quite unsteady,
Reels and slackens in his pace;
"Kicks the bucket," always ready;

"Gives it up"—Death wins the race.

For the Fall Trade.
We are in receipt of desirable and well selected stock
Staple and Fancy Dry Goods!

We have offered to the retail trade.
HAVING purchased this stock from the best Importers and
Commission Agents in the Eastern cities, we feel no hesitation
in saying that we are thereby enabled to sell goods at

Low Prices and on as Reasonable Terms as any house in the city.

Our present stock embraces every variety of

New and Fashionable Dress Goods
such as very handsome Robes Ala
Mode;
Tabis;
French Delaines, Plain and Fancy.
French and English Merinos;
Fancy Check Plaids;
Velvets for Travelling Dresses;
D'Ege's;
Plaid Merino, English and French;
Every style of Shawls, Plain and Fancy Dress Skirts and Coats;
Black Silks, various grades; together with other articles tedious.

We also have a very large stock of Staple Goods such as
Bleached Domestic, all grades;
1/2-4 bleached Sheeting;
1/2 inch Pillow case Cotton;
A. Brown Sheeting;
A and of Sea Island;
Brown and Blue drills;

Plaid Linsey, all kinds.
Flannels all colors, qualities and prices;
Canton Flannels;

Negro Blankets;

Bed Blankets, every size and quality;
Brown jeans, Linsey, Satinets, Cashmeres, Vests, Shirts,
Fronts, Collars, and in fact every article a person may
find in a complete retail store.
We keep constantly in hand complete
Shoes, Caps, Dufour & Co brand Boots;
Cloths, Carpets, &c. To which we invite the attention of the
cheapest McWHIRTER BROS.
Sep 15 No. 81. North Market street.
